{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415484","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415484","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041548401:1":{"text":"거참, 온도가 마음에 들지 않는군.","source_cn":"哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEADCDE2910A28BD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548402:1":{"text":"이곳에 눈을 내릴 수 없다는 게 안타까워. 빙결의 화염은 분명 아름다웠을 텐데.","source_cn":"可惜不能在这里降下一场大雪，不然，冻结的火焰一定会很美吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC667C7DB21B69AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548403:1":{"text":"그건 내가 할 말이야.","source_cn":"这话应该我来说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E1311A2C24A1A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548404:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아니었다면 넌 플레임 아래에서 수증기로 녹아버렸을 거야, 악마!","source_cn":"如果不是看在<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD72674C52E51B4D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아니었다면 넌 플레임 아래에서 수증기로 녹아버렸을 거야, 악마!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아니었다면 넌 플레임 아래에서 수증기로 녹아버렸을 거야, 악마!","variant_male_record_index":"251238","variant_female_record_index":"251239","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548405:1":{"text":"결투 게임이라도 하자는 거야? 좋아, 여긴 원탁에 둘러앉아 긴 이야기만 나누는 터라 심심했던 참이거든.","source_cn":"要来对战游戏吗？好啊，这里只有围在圆桌旁的长谈，可无聊呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FDE6D2ECE2CF0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548406:1":{"text":"한 번 해보는 게 어때? 네 화염을 얼음 속에 얼리면 어떻게 되는지 궁금하거든. 한때 존경받았던 그 전쟁 영웅의 얼음 조각상 속에도 마법의 화염이 타오르고 있으니까.","source_cn":"干脆来试试吧。我很好奇，你的火焰被冻结在冰里会是什么样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A708F0A40DEA35B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548407:1":{"text":"앰버 속에 갇힌 벌레 같으려나? 아니면 새장을 벗어나려는 새 같을까?","source_cn":"会像围困在琥珀里的虫子一样吗？还是像想要挣脱出牢笼的飞鸟呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1158A7336C2BEAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548408:1":{"text":"그래? 내 화염이 너의 무지한 자만을 불태워버릴 거야.","source_cn":"是吗？我的火焰将烧尽你无知的自负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED859C0B38856A3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548409:1":{"text":"그런 장난 조로 잔인한 말을 내뱉지 말라고, 악마. 대체 생명을 뭐라고 생각하는 거야? 그저 게임이라고 생각하는 거야?","source_cn":"不要用玩乐的语调吐出残忍的词语，恶魔，你把生命看作什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC00A8F9F2CABBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548410:1":{"text":"하나의 게임이 되는 게 뭐가 나빠?","source_cn":"能成为游乐项目之一，不是很好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF835EC540D88CFC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548411:1":{"text":"네 눈은 증오로 가득 차 있어. 그런 시선으로 다른 사람을 쳐다보는 건 무례하다는 거 몰라?","source_cn":"你的目光里满是仇恨，没人说过用那种目光打量别人很没礼貌吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FA97AD0BEB09D4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548412:1":{"text":"너 같은 악마를 대하는 데 예의를 갖추는 건 신에 대한 모독이야!","source_cn":"对待你这种恶魔，做出任何礼数都是对神明的亵渎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD967B73B22281E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548413:1":{"text":"아, 그것 참 재미있네. 신을 모독할 기회가 있다면 날 꼭 불러 줘. 놓치고 싶지 않으니까.","source_cn":"呀，那就太有趣了。要是有亵渎神明的机会，一定要叫上我哦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB905DCE539180201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蒂斯妮娅":{"text":"티스니아","source":"蒂斯妮娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"탈렌","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}